    10	rebalance. See `CLAUDE.md` § "The Novelty Bar" for the core criterion
    11	and `NOVELTY_CHALLENGES.md` for active construction targets.
    12	
    13	## Layout
    14	
    15	Each construction lives in its own subdirectory:
    16	
    17	```
    18	experiments/constructions/<descriptive_name>/
    19	    <name>.py              # runnable code that builds + evaluates the object
    20	    <name>_results.md      # what it does, what it doesn't, verdict
    21	                           # (C/E/I or "construction-incoherent")
    22	    definition.md          # signature + intended relationship to π(x);
    23	                           # required for algebraic objects, optional for circuits
    24	```
    25	
    26	## Bar for entry
    27	
    28	- **MUST run.** A theoretical-only essay is not a construction; turn it
